window.products.push({"id":751294,"name":"All Natural Soy Wax Melts (2 Pack) by E&E Company - Long Lasting Fragrances Infused with Essential Oil – Scented Soy Wax Cubes/Tarts for Electric/Teal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C0RBr9OmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our all natural soy wax cubes will melt all your problems away and have you feeling relaxed!   We use all natural vegetable based soy wax (vegan) with no paraffin or chemicals added. We use phthalate-free fragrances infused with essential oils for our products. Our melts/tarts can be used with any electric or tealight warmers. (Please use caution when using any devices.) The package contains 2 packs; each pack contains 6 cubes and weighs 3.0 oz. per pack. We guarantee you will enjoy hours of great scent that will uplift your mood and the environment.   Order your package simply by clicking “add to cart” and get ready to relax!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C0RBr9OmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E and E Company","source_asin":"B07XHH9SR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-751294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XHH9SR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XHH9SR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":751295,"name":"ForHauz Folding Dutch Oven Lid Stand, 7-7/8\", Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.14,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ltFJD6eTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you buy a Dutch oven, you may not be thinking about where you'll set it when you're done cooking, or how hard it will be to find a clean, safe place for it in the midst of a campfire meal. The ForHauz Dutch Oven Lid Stand is a convenient holder for you to set your Dutch oven lid while you're preparing your meal and when you're ready to serve. At just under 8 inches, it is small enough to travel with, and folds up easily so it's not bulky or cumbersome. Made from heavy duty steel with black coated finish, it stands up to heat so it also doubles as a trivet. Place the stand over warm coals and your lid upside down on top of the stand and it serves as a griddle! This stand is not only helpful for outdoor cooking, but can be used at home as a place to set your warm cast iron pans to serve food directly from, or as a platform for storage when not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ltFJD6eTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ForHauz","source_asin":"B01704J1CG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-751295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01704J1CG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01704J1CG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
