window.products.push({"id":751312,"name":"Amersun Kids Lunch Box with Multi-Pockets-Durable & Keep Food Warm Cold & Double Insulated School Lunch Cooler Bag with Water-Resistant Fabric for Kid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MkdFYcc6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THREE LAYERS OF PROTECTION: The outer layer of the kid's insulated lunch box is made of high-quality Oxford cloth, which is waterproof, wear-resistant and durable. The middle layer is made of 7MM insulating sponge to keep food warm or warm for hours. The inner layer is made of thickened aluminum foil, which is resistant to high temperature, easy to clean and durable. MORE THAN JUST PACKED LUNCHES: Size: 10.6\"Lx4.33\"Wx8.07\"H/ 27*11*20cm10.2\"L x 8.26\"H x 4.72\"W/26x21x12cm. Multi-pocket school lunch box designed for kids. The size is perfect for children 3 years or older. Compared to other kids' lunch bags of the same size, this multi-pocket can carry not only lunch, but also water bottles, cutlery, snacks, napkins, and more. ALSO HANDS-FREE: Kids Lovely lunch box with openable padded handle can be carried by hand or by attaching the lunch bag to a backpack for hands-free carrying. SAFE, DURABLE AND EASY TO CLEAN: Free from PVC, BPA and phthalates, making Amersun lunch boxes an eco-friendly choice. Perfect for your naughty child. 2-YEAR WORRY-FREE WARRANTY: Amersun offers friendly customer service. If there is any quality problem in kid's insulated lunch box within two years, please contact us through Amazon, we will reply within 24 hours and help you solve the problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MkdFYcc6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amersun","source_asin":"B0BZSD4JMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-751312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZSD4JMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZSD4JMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
