window.products.push({"id":751856,"name":"Oakestry Round Copper Plated Galvanized Steel tub for Farmhouse Decor Wine Chiller Beer Bucket for Drinks or Planter with Handle Multi Functional for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":71.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613gisqzQrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔰Old-fashioned farm tub design – these are the classic Galvanized Steel tubs ubiquitous on every farm because they have a thousand and one uses. Reminiscent of dairy cows and general stores, these tubs can give even the most urban garden a rustic country charm. These handmade tubs are fashioned with two side handles, making them easy to carry. The Round Tub measures 16 1/4\" Diameter x 10 1/4\"h. 🔰Galvanized Steel – Galvanized Steel has a protective zinc coating which prevents rusting, increasing the durability of these tubs even when used outdoors. These tubs are then additionally plated with a copper finish. 🔰Variety of shapes and Sizes – our galvanized tubs are available in a variety of shapes and Sizes. Mix and match designs for a cohesive decor theme. Choose from round and oval shapes in Small, medium, and large sizes, plain Galvanized Steel, copper-plated, and Black finishes, with banded, Hammered, or embossed designs. Refer to the gallery images for finishes and Dimensions. 🔰Variety of uses – this Galvanized Steel tub can be used as an ice bucket for chilling beverages in the summer. The large steel bucket has water-sealed seams to prevent leaking. In addition, the tub can be used to hold firewood during the winter, for container gardening as a vegetable or flower planter in the summer, even a doggie bathtub. If used for direct planting, we recommend drilling drainage holes in the bottom of the tub. 🔰Decorative Piece: Even when not in use for storage or planting, the galvanized tub can serve as a decorative piece in your home or garden. Its classic design and rustic charm can add a touch of character to your space","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613gisqzQrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oakestry","source_asin":"B09DYYP9BM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-751856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DYYP9BM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DYYP9BM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
