window.products.push({"id":751976,"name":"California King semi waveless waterbed Mattress with Zipper Cover & Heater","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":488.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l0ZzBjzmL._AC_SL1174_.jpg","description":"If you were looking for a semi wave waterbed mattress then this mattress kit may be the one for you. First the mattress kit includes a Bamboo zipper cover which will increase comfort by adding a very soft and breathable surface between you and the semi wave mattress. The cotton zipper cover unzips like a suite case and the waterbed heater, liner and mattress goes inside the cover. After it is filled you zip it closed for a nice look. The cover will help protect your mattress and you will also notice that your sheets will stay a lot better. The zipper cover will insulate the mattress so your heater turns on less. But most important the cover makes this already very comfortable semi wave water mattress even more comfortable. The very top part of the cover will unzip off for easy maintenance. The semi wave waterbed mattress has 1 layer of fiber which reduces the movement to about 10 seconds which is about half the movement of a free flow. But a semi wave is still has a good amount motion. The 12 mil safety liner is the best quality available so you know if you ever have an issue with the mattress you will have the proper protection. We also included are most reliable heating system that is manufactures by Calesco who not only makes waterbed heaters they also make heating systems for many large industries. Kit also includes 2 bottles of 8oz waterbed conditioner,1 bottle of bubble remover which will help air release while filling & a of bottle vinyl cleaner. Also included is a waterbed fill kit. If you like the better things in life and want semi wave mattress which is very comfortable then this is the mattress for you. Our Mattress Covers Amazon Store always has the newest products for your waterbed. Keep in mind that the waterbed frame is not included. If you have any questions feel free to email anytime. Mattress Covers appreciates your interest and hopes to serve you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l0ZzBjzmL._AC_SL1174_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U.S. Water, Aqua Fusion, Calesco","source_asin":"B00W5Q1LP0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-751976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00W5Q1LP0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00W5Q1LP0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":751977,"name":"BAKERYBEST Cupcake Boxes, Disposable Plastic Containers Holder, 6 Count 30 Pack Carrier, Bulk Transport Cupcakes, Tall Dome, Muffin Tray, Clear Contai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uBV5c5ZTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧁 PREMIUM CLAMSHELL CARRIERS TO TRANSPORT 180 PARTY CUP CAKE! - These 30 Packs of awesome delivery goodness are ready to use, straight out of the packaging with no hassle. Each carrier is 4\" high, from \"floor\" to \"ceiling with a 2-inch cup base and each container holds 6 standard sized cupcakes or muffin securely. No more flimsy cardboard boxes or worry about losing your expensive cupcake trays somewhere. These disposable cupcake holders are great for travel and reusable. 🧁 NON-SLIP & STACKABLE - Celebrate the safe arrival of your Cupcake masterpieces because these Cupcake Carriers locks the Lid and Base securely, saving you from a juggling frenzy during shipping. Our carriers are sturdy, easy to close, stay closed and easy to open with little pull tabs at the corners. Made of super strong material, the compartment will stack without caving in so you can stroll confidently into the party with your cupcake creations! 🧁 LAYER THOSE DECORATIVE FROSTING – Compatible with Wilton Cupcake Liners, there’s plenty of room with this Spacious and High Dome Lid for frosting, toppings or cupcake picks without them touching the top. Close the containers confidently and no more worrying about icing sticking to the lid upon removal. 🧁 HAVE CONFIDENCE WHEN EATING – Durable and high quality, the heat from warm cupcakes won’t bother the carriers or melt them! These carriers can be washed, air-dried and re-used several times while maintaining their original integrity. 🧁 MONEY BACK GUARANTEE - Try our Cupcake Carriers, it is backed by our BAKERY BEST 60-day Money-Back guarantee. If you aren't completely thrilled with your purchase, you can be assured of a full refund. No tricks. No excuses. Check @Bakesomehappiness on Facebook for warranty info.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uBV5c5ZTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAKERY BEST","source_asin":"B085NJMB4F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-751977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085NJMB4F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085NJMB4F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
